---
// StrataMap — the three strata of the Surface docs.
// Basics is the foundation; Daemons and Multi-host each rest on it
// INDEPENDENTLY (two separate pillars, not a single stacked ladder).
---

<figure class="doc-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 900 480"
    width="100%"
    height="auto"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="strata-title strata-desc"
  >
    <title id="strata-title">The three strata of a surface</title>
    <desc id="strata-desc">
      Basics is a wide foundation carrying three packages. Two independent
      pillars — Daemons and Multi-host — each rest on Basics on their own, side
      by side rather than stacked. Multi-host uses Daemons only when a remote
      box happens to run one.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker id="sm-arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="context-stroke" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Daemons pillar -->
    <rect x="90" y="70" width="320" height="205" rx="14"
      fill="color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-kolu-top-strong) 9%, var(--color-void-raised))"
      stroke="var(--color-kolu-top-strong)" stroke-width="1.6" />
    <text x="250" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="20.4" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-ink)">Daemons</text>
    <text x="250" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-muted)">long-lived local processes</text>
    <rect x="112" y="150" width="276" height="34" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
    <text x="250" y="172" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-dim)">@kolu/surface-daemon</text>
    <rect x="112" y="190" width="276" height="34" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
    <text x="250" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="14.4" fill="var(--color-ink-dim)">@kolu/surface-daemon-supervisor</text>
    <rect x="171" y="236" width="158" height="26" rx="13"
      fill="color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-kolu-top-strong) 16%, var(--color-void-raised))"
      stroke="var(--color-kolu-top-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="250" y="253" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="14.4" fill="var(--color-ink)">exemplar · <tspan font-weight="700">kaval</tspan></text>

    <!-- Multi-host pillar -->
    <rect x="490" y="70" width="320" height="205" rx="14"
      fill="color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-live-teal) 9%, var(--color-void-raised))"
      stroke="var(--color-kolu-bottom-strong)" stroke-width="1.6" />
    <text x="650" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="20.4" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-ink)">Multi-host</text>
    <text x="650" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-muted)">the same surface across an ssh fleet</text>
    <rect x="512" y="150" width="276" height="34" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
    <text x="650" y="172" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-dim)">@kolu/surface-remote</text>
    <rect x="512" y="190" width="276" height="34" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
    <text x="650" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-dim)">@kolu/surface-map</text>
    <rect x="571" y="236" width="158" height="26" rx="13"
      fill="color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-live-teal) 16%, var(--color-void-raised))"
      stroke="var(--color-kolu-bottom-strong)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="650" y="253" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="14.4" fill="var(--color-ink)">exemplar · <tspan font-weight="700">drishti</tspan></text>

    <!-- "sometimes" dashed link between the two pillars -->
    <line x1="410" y1="150" x2="490" y2="150" stroke="var(--color-ink-faint)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#sm-arr)" />
    <text x="450" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="14" fill="var(--color-ink-muted)">sometimes</text>

    <!-- independent struts down to the base -->
    <line x1="250" y1="275" x2="250" y2="337" stroke="var(--color-kolu-primary)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#sm-arr)" />
    <line x1="650" y1="275" x2="650" y2="337" stroke="var(--color-kolu-primary)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#sm-arr)" />
    <text x="250" y="322" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="14" fill="var(--color-kolu-primary)">builds on basics</text>
    <text x="650" y="322" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="14" fill="var(--color-kolu-primary)">builds on basics</text>

    <!-- Basics foundation -->
    <rect x="90" y="340" width="720" height="118" rx="14"
      fill="color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-kolu-primary) 8%, var(--color-void-raised))"
      stroke="var(--color-kolu-primary)" stroke-width="1.8" />
    <text x="450" y="374" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="20.4" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-ink)">Basics — the foundation</text>
    <text x="450" y="396" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-sans)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-muted)">one app, one process · declare · serve · consume</text>
    <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="15.0" fill="var(--color-ink-dim)">
      <rect x="132" y="414" width="180" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
      <text x="222" y="434" text-anchor="middle">@kolu/surface</text>
      <rect x="330" y="414" width="220" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
      <text x="440" y="434" text-anchor="middle">@kolu/surface-app</text>
      <rect x="568" y="414" width="200" height="30" rx="7" fill="var(--color-void-sunk)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" />
      <text x="668" y="434" text-anchor="middle">@kolu/surface-mcp</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Not a ladder: <strong>Basics</strong> is the foundation, and{" "}
    <strong>Daemons</strong> and <strong>Multi-host</strong> are independent
    doors that each rest on it on their own. Multi-host reaches for Daemons only
    when a remote box happens to run one.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .doc-diagram {
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .doc-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-void-sunk);
  }
  .doc-diagram figcaption {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: left;
  }
</style>
